# Gradle build output. Already in .gitignore, but graphify walks it anyway and drags the
# packaged launcher PNGs from app/build/intermediates into semantic extraction, where they cost
# an LLM call each and contribute nothing.
app/build/
build/
**/build/**
.gradle/
.kotlin/

# Directory patterns above do not reliably exclude the packaged launcher icons, so exclude the
# raster assets by extension too. Duck's real launcher and mascot art is vector XML.
*.png
**/*.png

# Agent + IDE config, not project code.
.claude/
.idea/

# Room's generated schema snapshot — committed, but it is a data dump, not source.
app/schemas/

# Markdown is excluded ONLY because semantic extraction needs a reachable model API and this
# machine's backend connection fails ("all semantic chunks failed for backend 'claude'"), which
# aborts the whole build before graph.json is written. Kotlin is unaffected: tree-sitter AST
# extraction is 100% local. Delete these three lines on a machine with a working backend to pull
# CLAUDE.md, DUCK_NOTES_BUILD_PROMPT.md and SETUP.md into the graph.
*.md
